Scope of the licence
--------------------

The part-number strings and maximum-stroke values reproduce what the original
manufacturer publishes in its catalogue. KINX asserts copyright only in the
selection and arrangement of this table, in its own derived columns and in the
accompanying text. Where a third party holds rights in an individual catalogue
value, this licence does not extend to that value.
